comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T22:46:08.676Z",claude-code-agent,"Duplicate check: searched all statuses for DeepScan, CodeFactor, hosted analysis, zero-new-issues, and quality-gate terms. Reusing pm-92if as parent and pm-bkcv/pm-6sqo/pm-3a68 as terminal lineage; none implements an exact-current-HEAD hosted-result verifier or requires DeepScan in branch protection. Trigger evidence: PR #684 head a61cdc0c has CodeFactor success titled 'No issues found.' but DeepScan failure '2 new and 0 fixed issues'; existing main protection requires CodeFactor but omits DeepScan."
  "2026-07-24T22:53:31.199Z",claude-code-agent,"Policy evidence: main branch protection was updated through the GitHub API without weakening any existing requirement. strict=true now requires both app-backed CodeFactor and DeepScan status contexts; CodeFactor remained app-bound (app_id 25603), and DeepScan was added as its legacy commit-status context. Focused TDD passes 32/32 tests; the first validator was correctly rejected by local complexity 20>16, then decomposed into analyzer-specific validators and pnpm quality:static passed without suppressions or threshold changes."
  "2026-07-24T23:22:45.280Z",claude-code-agent,"Local verification evidence: focused hosted-analysis/release-runner suite passes 42/42 tests after adding branch-protection policy cases. Complete sandboxed coverage passes 360/360 files and 6,284/6,284 tests at exact 100% statements (43,175/43,175), branches (30,627/30,627), functions (8,775/8,775), and lines (41,958/41,958). pnpm lint passes ESLint, zero jscpd clones across 745 files/416,942 lines, CodeFactor parity static quality, exact docstring coverage, package boundary, and token budgets. Typecheck, docs/skills, contracts, secret scan, and version policy pass. Manual packed-package consumer smoke in a fresh temporary directory passed init/create/update/comment, three exact-item mutation events, strict history verification, storage/history validation, and health."
  "2026-07-24T23:31:57.371Z",claude-code-agent,"Exact pushed-head proof: quality:hosted-analysis passed for commit 6bfcda25ce168a416d4288d5163e1475be8c37db with DeepScan explicitly reporting 0 new issues and CodeFactor reporting no issues found; strict main protection requires both contexts. CI static correctly rejected the generated changelog because pm-e200 remains actively reopened during review. Regenerated CHANGELOG.md through pm-changelog 2026.7.24 so the next head reflects current tracker truth; no hand edit or gate relaxation."
  "2026-07-24T23:34:00.121Z",claude-code-agent,"Merge closeout: the mandatory exact-head hosted-analysis command and strict main branch requirements for DeepScan plus CodeFactor are implemented in merged main commit a9967d951a6c5fd234ecd62453ba902d81c70693. The maintainer explicitly authorized a one-time administrator merge while six checks/reviews on final PR head 0e7bc05a were still pending. That exception does not weaken the permanent gate. Open unassigned pm-e3g0h6 owns terminal-result inventory and any next-PR remediation."
  "2026-07-26T00:30:00.440Z","harness:codex","Production defect and TDD evidence: Auto Release run 30180762050 passed the full local-quality phases but failed before tag creation because squash-merged main commit f355bcc4 had no DeepScan status; no release tag or package was created. A regression test first failed under the exact-commit-only resolver. The implementation now queries the unique merged PR association and compares immutable GitHub tree SHAs before reading the reviewed head. Focused suite passes 55/55, and the targeted source file is literal 100/100/100/100. Live read-only acceptance against main f355bcc4 resolves reviewed head f43b8936 as identical_tree_squash_pr_head and proves DeepScan 0 new plus CodeFactor no issues while strict main protection requires both."
  "2026-07-26T00:56:50.363Z","harness:codex","Final local verification: focused hosted-analysis and release-runner suite passes 63/63; combined changed-surface suite passes 67/67. Full direct coverage passes 371/371 files and 6,399/6,399 tests at statements 44,049/44,049, branches 31,261/31,261, functions 9,005/9,005, and lines 42,791/42,791. pnpm lint passes ESLint, zero jscpd clones across 769 files, static quality, exact source/export/member docstring coverage, package boundaries, token budgets, SDK surface, entrypoint costs, and CLI transport floors. Typecheck and git diff hygiene pass."
  "2026-07-26T01:25:57.539Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/721 (commit 8232a8c0)."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T23:22:45.928Z",claude-code-agent,"Hosted analyzer status must be verified against the full immutable Git SHA and paired with branch-protection policy. A green app result is insufficient if its context is not required; missing, pending, skipped, or ambiguous payloads must fail closed. Run whole-repository coverage serially because concurrent Vitest coverage processes intentionally collide on coverage/.tmp and invalidate evidence."
  "2026-07-26T00:30:01.237Z","harness:codex","Hosted analyzer applications may attach evidence only to a PR head, while squash merge commits preserve the exact tree but receive no copied status context. Safe release reuse therefore needs immutable tree equality plus a unique GitHub merged-PR association; commit-message inference or patch equivalence is insufficient and must fail closed."
